        "source": "https://static.warfarin.wiki/v3/audio/cn/char/chr_0002_endminm/chr_0002_endminm_chrup_promt03_01.mp3",
        "text": "过去和现在……必须合二为一。"
      },
      {
        "source": "https://static.warfarin.wiki/v3/audio/cn/char/chr_0002_endminm/chr_0002_endminm_chrup_promt04_01.mp3",
        "text": "我听见了她的声音，像是梦中的呢喃。我常在梦中遇见一片无垠的海，令人悲伤，令人怀念……也让我再一次下定决心。"
