      },
      {
        "source": "https://static.warfarin.wiki/v3/audio/cn/char/chr_0002_endminm/chr_0002_endminm_explore_find_locked_01.mp3",
        "text": "附近有需要调查的区域。"
      },
      {
        "source": "https://static.warfarin.wiki/v3/audio/cn/char/chr_0002_endminm/chr_0002_endminm_explore_find_danger_01.mp3",
        "text": "是强敌，谨慎应对。"
      },
      {
        "source": "https://static.warfarin.wiki/v3/audio/cn/char/chr_0002_endminm/chr_0002_endminm_interact_mine_valub_01.mp3",
